OL,3,GNEWSAHow one man and his sheepdog are
OL,4,Aheading to the world cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeclan McGee and his trusty dog Chip
OL,7,Fonly began taking part in the hugely
OL,8,Fcompetitive world of sheepdog trials
OL,9,Fless than three years ago.
OL,11,FIn that short space of time the Tyrone
OL,12,Fman and his five-year-old border collie
OL,13,Fhave been selected to represent Ireland
OL,14,Fand are about to compete in the World
OL,15,FSheepdog Trials.
OL,17,FThe prestigious competition only
OL,18,Fhappens every three years and brings
OL,19,Ftogether the world's best sheepdog
OL,20,Fhandlers.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
